1422],{"type":30,"value":1423},"We're looking for a Fullstack Engineer - AI. Headquartered in Los Angeles, California, Right Balance provides top-tier technology talent for innovative companies in the US. We’re in the top 50 companies to watch in LA.",{"type":24,"tag":25,"props":1425,"children":1426},{"id":40},[1427],{"type":30,"value":43},{"type":24,"tag":33,"props":1429,"children":1430},{},[1431],{"type":30,"value":1432},"The client is an AI-driven competitive intelligence platform built for modern e-commerce brands. They provide real-time visibility into market shifts by tracking hundreds of thousands of brands, retailers, and marketplaces across categories and channels. Their platform delivers insights on pricing, promotions, creative strategy, merchandising, and overall site experience, helping brands make faster and smarter decisions. Backed by experienced ecommerce operators and strong funding, they’re building a category-defining product at the intersection of AI and commerce intelligence.",{"type":24,"tag":33,"props":1434,"children":1435},{},[1436],{"type":30,"value":1437},"Our client is looking for someone who can really leverage AI. Not building it, but using Claude, Gemini, OpenAI APIs like they're native tools. Think autonomous email systems that research prospects, draft emails, then handle replies when they come in.",{"type":24,"tag":65,"props":1439,"children":1440},{},[1441,1446],{"type":24,"tag":69,"props":1442,"children":1443},{},[1444],{"type":30,"value":1445},"Availability: Full-time. Looking for 5+ hours Pacific Time overlap.",{"type":24,"tag":69,"props":1447,"children":1448},{},[1449],{"type":30,"value":1450},"You will talk directly with customers.",{"type":24,"tag":25,"props":1452,"children":1453},{"id":124},[1454],{"type":30,"value":127},{"type":24,"tag":129,"props":1456,"children":1457},{},[1458,1462,1466,1470],{"type":24,"tag":69,"props":1459,"children":1460},{},[1461],{"type":30,"value":136},{"type":24,"tag":69,"props":1463,"children":1464